    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aimed at promoting better filmmaking among students, FFACT'14 (Film Festival by Aga Khan Club for Theatrics 2014) provided an opportunity to encourage exchange of ideas and skills with other universities in the field of theatre and filmmaking. This year's event was unique in that it also included photography as part of the festival.",
